      "concept": "Furniture-edge childproofing",
      "primary_text": "If furniture edges are on your childproofing checklist, start with a specific detail. The Peach Bucket 6-in-1 Child Safety Kit includes edge and corner protectors, giving you a way to address table corners and other furniture edges as you plan your home. They’re one part of childproofing—not a substitute for adult supervision. Explore the kit.",
