    },
    {
      "concept": "Including outlets in the plan",
      "primary_text": "Childproofing isn’t only about furniture. The Peach Bucket 6-in-1 Child Safety Kit also includes socket guards, so outlets can be part of the childproofing plan you make for your home. Consider which areas you want to address, and remember that adult supervision remains important. See the kit details.",
      "headline": "Socket guards for your childproofing plan",
      "cta": "See details"
    },
    {
      "concept": "Guidance with installation",
      "primary_text": "Want guidance as you work through installation? The Peach Bucket 6-in-1 Child Safety Kit includes 1-to-1 installation video support, so you can get help with the process rather than figuring out each step alone. If installation support matters to you, take a look at the kit and what’s included.",
      "headline": "Get 1-to-1 installation video support",
      "cta": "Explore the kit"
    }
  ],
